" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-358\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2023-09-02-at-14.08.261-150x150-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-359\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2023-11-09-at-05.08.32-150x150-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-360\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2023-11-09-at-05.08.52-150x150-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-361\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2023-11-09-at-05.09.01-150x150-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" />', 'Learning made easy with Positive Energy: 2 Lakh Children Trained', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '281-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-10-26 23:11:51', '2026-10-26 17:41:51', '', 281, 'http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/?p=365', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(366, 1, '2026-10-26 23:15:54', '2026-10-26 17:45:54', '{\n    \"custom_css[custom-child-theme]\": {\n        \"value\": \"/* Makes images inside the post sit side-by-side */\\n.entry-content img, \\n.post-content img {\\n    display: inline-block !important;\\n    width: 23%; /* Adjust this % to fit more or less per row */\\n    height: auto;\\n    margin: 1% 0.5%;\\n    vertical-align: top;\\n    border-radius: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n/* Ensures paragraphs holding images don\'t break */\\n.entry-content p:has(img) {\\n    display: inline-block;\\n}\",\n        \"type\": \"custom_css\",\n        \"user_id\": 1,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-10-26 17:45:54\"\n    }\n}', '', '', 'trash', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1d27ef6b-2663-4862-8fdf-83ff951c54cc', '', '', '2026-10-26 23:15:54', '2026-10-26 17:45:54', '', 0, 'http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/1d27ef6b-2663-4862-8fdf-83ff951c54cc/', 0, 'customize_changeset', '', 0),
(367, 1, '2026-10-26 23:15:54', '2026-10-26 17:45:54', '\n/* Arrange multiple images inside WordPress post content in a row */\n.single-post .entry-content p:has(> img) {\n    display: flex !important;\n    flex-direction: row !important;\n    flex-wrap: wrap !important;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 12px;\n}\n\n/* Remove WordPress alignment spacing */\n.single-post .entry-content p:has(> img) > img {\n    display: block !important;\n    float: none !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    width: calc(33.333% - 8px) !important;\n    max-width: calc(33.333% - 8px) !important;\n    height: auto !important;\n    object-fit: contain;\n}\n\n/* Responsive layout */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .single-post .entry-content p:has(> img) > img {\n        width: calc(50% - 6px) !important;\n        max-width: calc(50% - 6px) !important;\n    }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .single-post .entry-content p:has(> img) > img {\n        width: 100% !important;\n        max-width: 100% !important;\n    }\n}\n', 'custom-child-theme', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'custom-child-theme', '', '', '2026-10-26 23:26:42', '2026-10-26 17:56:42', '', 0, 'http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/custom-child-theme/', 0, 'custom_css', '', 0),
(368, 1, '2026-10-26 23:15:54', '2026-10-26 17:45:54', '/* Makes images inside the post sit side-by-side */\n.entry-content img, \n.post-content img {\n    display: inline-block !important;\n    width: 23%; /* Adjust this % to fit more or less per row */\n    height: auto;\n    margin: 1% 0.5%;\n    vertical-align: top;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n}\n\n/* Ensures paragraphs holding images don\'t break */\n.entry-content p:has(img) {\n    display: inline-block;\n}', 'custom-child-theme', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '367-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-10-26 23:15:54', '2026-10-26 17:45:54', '', 367, 'http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/?p=368', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(369, 1, '2026-10-26 23:20:05', '2026-10-26 17:50:05', '{\n    \"custom_css[custom-child-theme]\": {\n        \"value\": \"/* Force images into a flexible grid */\\n.wp-block-image {\\n    display: inline-block !important;\\n    width: 24% !important; /* 4 images per row */\\n    margin: 0 0.5% 10px 0.5% !important;\\n    vertical-align: top;\\n}\\n\\n/* Make sure the actual image fills that block */\\n.wp-block-image img {\\n    width: 100% !important;\\n    height: auto !important;\\n    border-radius: 6px;\\n}\\n\\n/* Responsive adjustment for mobile */\\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\\n    .wp-block-image {\\n        width: 48% !important; /* 2 images per row on phones */\\n    }\\n}\",\n        \"type\": \"custom_css\",\n        \"user_id\": 1,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-10-26 17:50:05\"\n    }\n}', '', '', 'trash', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'a0376f16-be41-4a07-80b8-175de2badfb6', '', '', '2026-10-26 23:20:05', '2026-10-26 17:50:05', '', 0, 'http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/?p=369', 0, 'customize_changeset', '', 0),
(370, 1, '2026-10-26 23:20:05', '2026-10-26 17:50:05', '/* Force images into a flexible grid */\n.wp-block-image {\n    display: inline-block !important;\n    width: 24% !important; /* 4 images per row */\n    margin: 0 0.5% 10px 0.5% !important;\n    vertical-align: top;\n}\n\n/* Make sure the actual image fills that block */\n.wp-block-image img {\n    width: 100% !important;\n    height: auto !important;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n}\n\n/* Responsive adjustment for mobile */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .wp-block-image {\n        width: 48% !important; /* 2 images per row on phones */\n    }\n}', 'custom-child-theme', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '367-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-10-26 23:20:05', '2026-10-26 17:50:05', '', 367, 'http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/?p=370', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(371, 1, '2026-10-26 23:21:03', '2026-10-26 17:51:03', '{\n    \"custom_css[custom-child-theme]\": {\n        \"value\": \"/* Force images inside standard paragraphs to sit side-by-side */\\n.entry-content p img, \\n.wp-block-post-content p img,\\n.post-content p img {\\n    display: inline-block !important;\\n    vertical-align: top !important;\\n    width: 24% !important; /* 4 images per row */\\n    height: auto !important;\\n    margin: 0 0.5% 10px 0.5% !important;\\n    border-radius: 6px;\\n}\\n\\n/* On mobile phones, show 2 images per row */\\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\\n    .entry-content p img, \\n    .wp-block-post-content p img,\\n    .post-content p img {\\n        width: 48% !important; \\n    }\\n}\",\n        \"type\": \"custom_css\",\n        \"user_id\": 1,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-10-26 17:51:03\"\n    }\n}', '', '', 'trash', 'closed', 'closed', '', '948f9275-f22b-4029-9665-00e173ac155b', '', '', '2026-10-26 23:21:03', '2026-10-26 17:51:03', '', 0, 'http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/948f9275-f22b-4029-9665-00e173ac155b/', 0, 'customize_changeset', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(372, 1, '2026-10-26 23:21:03', '2026-10-26 17:51:03', '/* Force images inside standard paragraphs to sit side-by-side */\n.entry-content p img, \n.wp-block-post-content p img,\n.post-content p img {\n    display: inline-block !important;\n    vertical-align: top !important;\n    width: 24% !important; /* 4 images per row */\n    height: auto !important;\n    margin: 0 0.5% 10px 0.5% !important;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n}\n\n/* On mobile phones, show 2 images per row */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .entry-content p img, \n    .wp-block-post-content p img,\n    .post-content p img {\n        width: 48% !important; \n    }\n}', 'custom-child-theme', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '367-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-10-26 23:21:03', '2026-10-26 17:51:03', '', 367, 'http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/?p=372', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(373, 1, '2026-10-27 10:06:30', '2026-10-27 04:36:30', 'For many years, trainers of Universalknowledge.in have mastered and perfected the techniques of betterment in daily life which is easy for children to grasp. Trainers provide training on various simple easy unique techniques to schools in order to perform better than before from Day 1 of the training.\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-283\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/content-img-768x576-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\" />\n<p class=\"mb-3\">Trainers from Universal Knowledge will train your Students to make them understand subjects easily to score very good marks in their Academic career. This program will help students to balance their brain and excel with their own in-born talent using the ancient methods written in the book <strong>“Learning made easy with Positive Energy”</strong> authored by <strong>Master Rohan M. Shiri</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"mb-4\">The training will help students to build their Positivity and increase their brain capacity by practicing simple techniques taught in the training program. Universal knowledge team has been training students since 2018 and this has helped many students to score very high marks and also build their talents and excel in the same by practicing. Many Schools where the programs were conducted have achieved 100% results in their academic year.</p>\n<p class=\"mb-4\">Topics covered are:\nBrain Balancing, Super Brain Yoga, Obtaining knowledge, Cutting unwanted thoughts, Removing negativity. Breathing techniques, Exercises, Keeping body fit.Truth, Forgiveness, Thankfullness, Joyfullness.<a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaEG91p0lwgifY3k4P31\">\nhttps://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaEG91p0lwgifY3k4P31</a></p>\n&nbsp;\n\nThis programme can bring great results immediately and the details of which are as mentioned in the brochure below. Submit your details if interested in participating\n\n<a href=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/all-our-events\">http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/all-our-events</a>\n\n<a href=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Brochers-1-1.pdf\">Brochers-1-1</a>\n\nTraining materials and Downloads are available at <a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold ukt-article-text-link\" href=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/downloads-for-school-training-programs/\">downloads</a>.\n\n[modula id=\"423\"]\n\nUniversal Knowledge trust in association with Grama Vikas society and Education department Govt of Karnataka training 1,00,000 students for 9th and 10th std. Students, first batch of 2 days teachers training started from 3rd Aug 2023.\n\n[modula id=\"433\"]\n<h4 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\"><a class=\"text-decoration-none ukt-article-text-link\" href=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/reviews-on-website\">Reviews for Universal knowledge from Teachers and HM’s</a></h4>\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-295\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-11-03-at-06.46.59-1-150x150-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-296\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-11-03-at-06.46.59-2-150x150-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-297\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-11-03-at-06.46.59-150x150-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-298\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-11-03-at-06.47.39-1-150x150-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-m