(431, 1, '2026-10-27 10:03:24', '2026-10-27 04:33:24', 'For many years, trainers of Universalknowledge.in have mastered and perfected the techniques of betterment in daily life which is easy for children to grasp. Trainers provide training on various simple easy unique techniques to schools in order to perform better than before from Day 1 of the training.\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-283\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/content-img-768x576-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\" />\r\n<p class=\"mb-3\">Trainers from Universal Knowledge will train your Students to make them understand subjects easily to score very good marks in their Academic career. This program will help students to balance their brain and excel with their own in-born talent using the ancient methods written in the book <strong>“Learning made easy with Positive Energy”</strong> authored by <strong>Master Rohan M. Shiri</strong>.</p>\r\n<p class=\"mb-4\">The training will help students to build their Positivity and increase their brain capacity by practicing simple techniques taught in the training program. Universal knowledge team has been training students since 2018 and this has helped many students to score very high marks and also build their talents and excel in the same by practicing. Many Schools where the programs were conducted have achieved 100% results in their academic year.</p>\r\n<p class=\"mb-4\">Topics covered are:\r\nBrain Balancing, Super Brain Yoga, Obtaining knowledge, Cutting unwanted thoughts, Removing negativity. Breathing techniques, Exercises, Keeping body fit.Truth, Forgiveness, Thankfullness, Joyfullness.<a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaEG91p0lwgifY3k4P31\">\r\nhttps://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaEG91p0lwgifY3k4P31</a></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThis programme can bring great results immediately and the details of which are as mentioned in the brochure below. Submit your details if interested in participating\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/all-our-events\">http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/all-our-events</a>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Brochers-1-1.pdf\">Brochers-1-1</a>\r\n\r\nTraining materials and Downloads are available at <a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold ukt-article-text-link\" href=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/downloads-for-school-training-programs/\">downloads</a>.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-285 size-full\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-11-03-at-06.46.13-150x150-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-286\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-11-03-at-06.45.43-150x150-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-287\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-11-03-at-06.45.44-1-150x150-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-288\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-11-03-at-06.45.44-150x150-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-289\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-11-03-at-06.45.45-1-150x150-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-290\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-11-03-at-06.45.45-150x150-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-291\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-11-03-at-06.46.13-1-150x150-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" />\r\n\r\nUniversal Knowledge trust in association with Grama Vikas society and Education department Govt of Karnataka training 1,00,000 students for 9th and 10th std. Students, first batch of 2 days teachers training started from 3rd Aug 2023.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-292\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2023-08-04-at-05.12.26-300x135-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"135\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-293\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2023-08-04-at-05.12.261-300x135-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"135\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-294\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2023-08-05-at-08.19.40-300x135-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"135\" />\r\n<h4 class=\"fw-bold mb-3\"><a class=\"text-decoration-none ukt-article-text-link\" href=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/reviews-on-website\">Reviews for Universal knowledge from Teachers and HM’s</a></h4>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-295\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-11-03-at-06.46.59-1-150x150-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-296\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-11-03-at-06.46.59-2-150x150-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-297\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/WhatsApp-Image-2022-11-03-at-0