\r\n                                    Teaching by Hlr. Leelavathi\r\n                                </p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"mt-3 pt-2 border-top small text-muted d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between ukt-stop-video-meta\">\r\n                                <span><i class=\"bi bi-person-fill me-1 text-success\"></i> Hlr. Leelavathi</span>\r\n                                <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FJmmXSc3xMc\" target=\"_blank\"\r\n                                    rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-danger text-decoration-none fw-semibold\">\r\n                                    <i class=\"bi bi-play-circle-fill text-danger me-1\"></i> YouTube\r\n                                </a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Video 2: STOP Chapter 17 -->\r\n                <div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\r\n                    <div class=\"card border-0 rounded-4 shadow-sm h-100 overflow-hidden ukt-stop-video-card\">\r\n                        <div class=\"ratio ratio-16x9\">\r\n                            <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BGcCs8bt-qA\"\r\n                                title=\"STOP: Chapter 17 – Teaching by Hlr. krishan Thimmaiah\" loading=\"lazy\"\r\n                                allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\"\r\n                                allowfullscreen class=\"border-0\"></iframe>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"card-body p-4 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between\">\r\n                            <div>\r\n                                <span class=\"badge mb-2 fw-medium ukt-stop-video-badge\">Chapter\r\n                                    17</span>\r\n                                <h5 class=\"lh-s