rrer\" class=\"badge text-decoration-none fw-medium ukt-article-cat-badge\">Training\r\nfor Youths</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://universalknowledge.in/category/events/universal-talks/\" target=\"_blank\"\r\nrel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"badge text-decoration-none fw-medium ukt-article-cat-badge\">Universal\r\nTalks</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://universalknowledge.in/category/programmes/upliftment-programmes/\"\r\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"badge text-decoration-none fw-medium ukt-article-cat-badge\">Upliftment\r\nProgrammes</a>\r\n<span class=\"text-secondary fw-bold mx-2 ukt-breadcrumb-sm\">•</span>\r\n<span class=\"fw-normal text-secondary ukt-article-date-text\">Aug 30, 2021</span>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- HASHTAGS INSIDE HERO CARD CONTAINER -->\r\n<div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-1 pt-3 border-top border-secondary-subtle\">\r\n<span class=\"fw-semibold me-2 align-self-center text-secondary small\"><i\r\nclass=\"bi bi-tags-fill me-1\"></i>Tags:</span>\r\n<a href=\"https://universalknowledge.in/tag/positive/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\r\nclass=\"badge text-decoration-none fw-normal ukt-article-tag-pill\">#Positive</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://universalknowledge.in/tag/program/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\r\nclass=\"badge text-decoration-none fw-normal ukt-article-tag-pill\">#Program</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://universalknowledge.in/tag/shammy-shiri/\" target=\"_blank\"\r\nrel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"badge text-decoration-none fw-normal ukt-article-tag-pill\">#Shammy\r\nShiri</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://universalknowledge.in/tag/stop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\r\nclass=\"badge text-decoration-none fw-normal ukt-article-tag-pill\">#STOP</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://universalknowledge.in/tag/training-and-speeches/\" target=\"_blank\"\r\nrel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"badge text-decoration-none fw-normal ukt-article-tag-pill\">#Training\r\nand Speeches</a>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</header>\r\n\r\n<!-- =========================================================\r\nARTICLE MAIN BODY & SIDEBAR CONTAINER\r\n========================================================== -->\r\n<div class=\"container pb-5 text-start\">\r\n<div class=\"row g-4 g-lg-5\">\r\n\r\n<!-- MAIN ARTICLE CONTENT (LEFT COLUMN) -->\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-8\">\r\n\r\n<!-- FEATURED ARTICLE COVER IMAGE -->\r\n<div class=\"mb-4 text-center\">\r\n<figure class=\"ukt-article-featured-frame\">\r\n<img src=\"images/stop_aticle_cover.webp\" alt=\"STOP – Short Transcendent Orientation Program\"\r\nclass=\"ukt-article-featured-img\">\r\n<figcaption class=\"visually-hidden\">STOP: Short Transcendent Orientation Program Cover Image\r\n</figcaption>\r\n</figure>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- NARRATIVE PARAGRAPHS -->\r\n<div class=\"article-body-text lead-text fs-5 mb-4 ukt-article-lead-body\">\r\n<p class=\"mb-3\">\r\nOrganized by <a href=\"http://www.universalknowledge.in/\" target=\"_blank\"\r\nrel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold ukt-article-text-link\">Universal Knowledge</a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"mb-3\">\r\n1 hr session / 3 days in a week<br>\r\n6 Life coach / 18 hrs totally<br>\r\nMonday / Wednesday / Friday<br>\r\n6:00 PM to 7:00 PM\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"mb-3\">\r\nLanguage: Kannada and English<br>\r\nStarting from: 30th August to October 8th 2021\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"mb-3\">\r\nFree Live online session Limited entry<br>\r\nTo register : <a href=\"https://forms.gle/BVL6DeyBT5agr1786\" target=\"_blank\"\r\nrel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-decoration-underline fw-semibold ukt-article-text-link\">https://forms.gle/BVL6DeyBT5agr1786</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- IN-ARTICLE CONTENT IMAGE -->\r\n<div class=\"my-4 text-center\">\r\n<figure class=\"ukt-article-inline-figure\">\r\n<img src=\"images/stop_article_content-1.webp\"\r\nalt=\"STOP Short Transcendent Orientation Program - Our Life Coaches\" loading=\"lazy\"\r\nclass=\"ukt-article-inline-img\">\r\n<figcaption class=\"visually-hidden\">STOP Short Transcendent Orientation Program Life\r\nCoaches</figcaption>\r\n</figure>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"mb-3\">\r\nAre you ready to STOP <a href=\"http://www.universalknowledge.in/\" target=\"_blank\"\r\nrel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold ukt-article-text-link\">www.universalknowledge.in</a><br>\r\nShort Transcendent Orientation Program<br>\r\nPowered by.Universal Knowledge<br>\r\nLanguage: Kannanda and English<br>\r\nAre you ready to STOP<br>\r\n<a href=\"http://www.universalknowledge.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\r\nclass=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold ukt-article-text-link\">www.universalknowledge.in</a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"mb-3\">\r\n<strong>Now available on YouTube</strong>\r\n</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- SIDEBAR (RIGHT COLUMN) -->\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\r\n<div class=\"sticky-top ukt-article-sticky-sidebar\">\r\n\r\n<!-- RELATED POSTS WIDGET (BACKGROUND IMAGE, MAX 3 TAGS, TITLE & DATE IN COLUMN FORMAT) -->\r\n<div class=\"mb-4\">\r\n<h4 class=\"h6 fw-bold mb-3 ukt-article-sidebar-heading\">\r\n<i class=\"bi bi-journal-text me-2 text-success\"></i>Related Posts\r\n</h4>\r\n\r\n<!-- RELATED POST CARD 1 -->\r\n<div class=\"card border-0 rounded-4 overflow-hidden shadow-sm mb-3 position-relative text-white ukt-sidebar-banner-frame\">\r\n<figure class=\"ukt-sidebar-banner-figure\">\r\n<img src=\"images/related-post/related-post-1.jpg\"\r\nalt=\"School Training Program News Article – Punch Tv Kolar\"\r\ntitle=\"Punch Tv Kolar School Training\" loading=\"lazy\"\r\nclass=\"ukt-sidebar-banner-img\">\r\n<div class=\"ukt-sidebar-banner-overlay\"></div>\r\n<figcaption class=\"visually-hidden\">Punch Tv Kolar School Training Background Image\r\n</figcaption>\r\n</figure>\r\n<div class=\"card-body p-4 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between position-relative h-100 ukt-sidebar-banner-frame\">\r\n<!-- TOP: UTMOST 3 TAGS -->\r\n<div class=\"d-flex flex-