\r\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-4 border-top border-secondary-subtle\">\r\n<div class=\"mb-4\">\r\n<p class=\"mb-2 fw-semibold text-dark\">ಹಸಿವು ಮುಕ್ತ ಸಮಾಜಕ್ಕಾಗಿ ಫುಡ್ ಆನ್ ವಾಲ್: ಇದೀಗ ಶಿವಮೊಗ್ಗದಲ್ಲಿ ಆರಂಭ</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled d-flex flex-column gap-2 mb-3\">\r\n 	<li><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold ukt-article-text-link\" href=\"https://kalpa.news/shivamogga-food-on-wall-for-a-hunger-free-society-starting-now-in-shimoga/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://kalpa.news/shivamogga-food-on-wall-for-a-hunger-free-society-starting-now-in-shimoga/</a></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"small text-muted\">ಸುದ್ಧಿ ಹಾಗೂ ಜಾಹೀರಾತಿಗಾಗಿ ಸಂಪರ್ಕಿಸಿ: Whatsapp: 9008761663, 9481252093 – <a class=\"text-decoration-none\" href=\"mailto:info@kalpa.news\">info@kalpa.news</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"mb-2 fw-semibold text-dark\">ಕನ್ನಡಪ್ರಭ</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled d-flex flex-column gap-2 mb-3\">\r\n 	<li><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold ukt-article-text-link\" href=\"https://kpepaper.asianetnews.com/c/72906785\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://kpepaper.asianetnews.com/c/72906785</a></li>\r\n 	<li><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold ukt-article-text-link\" href=\"https://kpepaper.asianetnews.com/3731816/Shivamogga/SHIMOGA#page/9/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://kpepaper.asianetnews.com/3731816/Shivamogga/SHIMOGA#page/9/1</a></li>\r\n 	<li><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold ukt-article-text-link\" href=\"https://kpepaper.asianetnews.com/3731816/Shivamogga/SHIMOGA#page/9/2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://kpepaper.asianetnews.com/3731816/Shivamogga/SHIMOGA#page/9/2</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-top border-secondary-subtle\">\r\n<p class=\"mb-2\"><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold text-success\" href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/CxUij7EAqeP4VDQKG3F061\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ಸುದ್ದಿಲೈವ್ ವಾಟ್ಸಪ್ ಗ್ರೂಪ್ ಗೆ ಸೇರಲು ಈ ಕೆಳಗಿನ ಲಿಂಕ್ ಒತ್ತಿ Join Food on Wall Whatsapp group [https://chat.whatsapp.com/CxUij7EAqeP4VDQKG3F061]</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"mb-1 fw-bold text-dark\">Crossed feeding 5900+ hungry…</p>\r\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-secondary\">9 Hotels, Meals served 5904 from January 2023</p>\r\n<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-541 aligncenter\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/food-on-wall-logo.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"232\" height=\"300\" /> <img class=\"size-medium wp-image-542 aligncenter\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/final-image.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"146\" />\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Captured Moments</strong></p>\r\n[modula id=\"544\"]', 'Food On Wall', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'food-on-wall', '', '', '2026-10-27 18:02:29', '2026-10-27 12:32:29', '', 0, 'http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/?p=520', 0, 'post', '', 0),
