(554, 1, '2026-10-27 18:02:09', '2026-10-27 12:32:09', '<p class=\"mb-3\">On the occasion of 74th Republic day celebration, Universal Knowledge Trust ® launched Food on Wall free food for needy. Food on the wall is an ongoing concept where Universal knowledge trust ® partners with Hotel owners to provide free food for the needy at a minimum cost of ₹ 50/- per person.</p>\n<p class=\"mb-3\">General public can join hands with Universal knowledge trust to give away free food for needy by donating the same through hotel counter or through trust account.\nFood on wall is not just feeding the needy.It is an idea to get good people in a single platform, so that we all can grow together with positive energy.</p>\n<p class=\"mb-3\">It is just not about feeding the needy, but a feeling of oneness in your heart\nwhen you see their simple smile.</p>\n<p class=\"mb-3\">It is just not about filling an empty stomach, but a wonderful way to understand human relationships.</p>\n<p class=\"mb-3\">It is just not a way of showing love, but a way to show we are humans and are built like that.</p>\n<p class=\"mb-4\">Come join hands be a part of this Nobel deed.</p>\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-521\" src=\"http://localhost/universal-knowledge-trust-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/food-on-wall-cover-img.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"543\" />\n<h4 class=\"h5 fw-bold text-dark mb-3\">1. The first program has been started at Hotel Shiva kripa, Puttur</h4>\n[modula id=\"523\"]\n<h4 class=\"h5 fw-bold text-dark mb-3\">2. Food on wall at Prabhu Restaurant, near Karkala, Karnataka</h4>\n[modula id=\"528\"]\n<h4 class=\"h5 fw-bold text-dark mb-3\">3. Food on wall started today at Kings hotel kambala mangaluru…ex corporator Mr. Devanand Pai… Trustee of Sri venkataramana temple Sri Sathish Prabhu…Hlr. Dinaker Shetty and Hlr. Ganesh Prasad were present in this occasion</h4>\n[modula id=\"532\"]\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-top border-secondary-subtle\">\n<div class=\"mb-4\">\n<p class=\"mb-3\"><strong>4. 12nov2024</strong> Universal knowledge ಮತ್ತು ಗ್ರಾಮ ವಿಕಾಸ್ trust ಜಂಟಿ ಆಶ್ರಯದಲ್ಲಿ ಮಂಗಳೂರಿನಲ್ಲಿ Food on wheels ಕಾರ್ಯಕ್ರಮಕ್ಕೆ ನಿನ್ನೆ Ukt trust ಕಛೇರಿಯ ಎದುರು ಉಚಿತ ಊಟದ ವಾಹನಕ್ಕೆ ನೆರೆದ UKT ಸದಸ್ಯರ ಸಮ್ಮುಖದಲ್ಲಿ ಹಸಿರು ಬಾವುಟ ತೋರಿಸುವ ಮೂಲಕ ಹೀಲರ್ ಗಣೇಶ್ ಪ್ರಸಾದ್ ಚಾಲನೆ ನೀಡಿದರು,</p>\n<p class=\"mb-3\">ಆ ಸಂಧರ್ಭದಲ್ಲಿ ಅಲ್ಲಿಗೆ ಆಗಮಿಸಿದ ಬಸವಣ್ಣ ಮೊದಲ ಊಟವನ್ನು ಸವಿಯುವ ಮೂಲಕ ಅನ್ನ ಪ್ರಸಾದ ಸೇವಿಸಿ ಸಂಭ್ರಮಿಸಿತು,</p>\n<p class=\"mb-3\">ಈ ವಾಹನವು ಇನ್ನು ಪ್ರತಿ ನಿತ್ಯ ಮಂಗಳೂರಿನ ವಿವಿಧ ಭಾಗಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಈ ಉಚಿತ ಊಟವನ್ನು ವಿತರಿಸಲಿದೆ,</p>\n<p class=\"mb-3\">Healer Ganesh Prasad launched the Food on Wheels program in Mangalore under the joint auspices of Universal Knowledge and Gram Vikas Trust yesterday in the presence of the UKT members gathered in the free meal vehicle in front of the UKT trust office by showing the green flag.</p>\n<p class=\"mb-3\">On that occasion, Basavanna, who arrived there, celebrated by tasting the first meal and consuming Anna Prasada.</p>\n<p class=\"mb-3\">This vehicle will now distribute these free meals in different parts of Mangalore every day.</p>\n<p class=\"mb-3\">ಈಗಾಗಲೇ ರಾಜ್ಯದ 12 ಹೋಟೆಲ್ ಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಉಚಿತ ಊಟದ ವ್ಯವಸ್ಥೆ FOOD ON WALL ಮೂಲಕ ಸುಮಾರು 40 ಸಾವಿರ ಊಟ ವಿತರಿಸಿದ್ದು- ವಾಹನದ ಮೂಲಕ- food on wheel ಈಗಾಗಲೇ ಧಾರವಾಡದಲ್ಲಿ ಈಗಾಗಲೇ ಪ್ರತಿನಿತ್ಯ ಉಚಿತವಾಗಿ ಊಟವನ್ನು ಅಗತ್ಯ ಇದ್ದ ಎಲ್ಲಾ ರೀತಿಯ ಜನರಿಗೂ ಹಂಚುವ ವ್ಯವಸ್ಥೆ ಮಾಡಲಾಗಿದ್ದು ಇದೀಗ ಮಂಗಳೂರಿನಲ್ಲಿಯೂ ಈ food in wheel ಕಾರ್ಯಾರಂಭ ಗೊಂಡಿದೆ,</p>\n<p class=\"mb-4\">Around 40,000 meals have already been distributed in 12 hotels of the state through FOOD ON WALL, food on wheel has already been arranged in Dharwad to distribute free meals to all kinds of people in need</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-4 border-top border-secondary-subtle\">\n<h3 class=\"h4 fw-bold text-dark mb-4\">In The News</h3>\n<div class=\"mb-4\">\n<p class=\"mb-2 fw-medium text-dark\">Food on wall By. Universal Knowledge, A report:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled d-flex flex-column gap-2 mb-3\">\n 	<li><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold ukt-article-text-link\" href=\"https://fb.watch/nGjIQrsV3d/?mibextid=2Rb1fB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Food on wall By. Universal Knowledge, A report [https://fb.watch/nGjIQrsV3d/?mibextid=2Rb1fB]</a></li>\n 	<li><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold ukt-article-text-link\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=853732256344199&amp;ref=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=853732256344199&amp;ref=sharing</a></li>\n 	<li><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold ukt-article-text-link\" href=\"https://suddilive.in/?p=24472\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ನೀವು ದಾನಿಗಳಾಗಿ…! [https://suddilive.in/?p=24472]</a></li>\n 	<li><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold text-success\" href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/CxUij7EAqeP4VDQKG3F061\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ಸುದ್ದಿಲೈವ್ ವಾಟ್ಸಪ್ ಗ್ರೂಪ್ ಗೆ ಸೇರಲು ಈ ಕೆಳಗಿನ ಲಿಂಕ್ ಒತ್ತಿ Join Food on Wall Whatsapp group [https://chat.whatsapp.com/CxUij7EAqeP4VDQKG3F061]</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-4\">\n<h4 class=\"h6 fw-bold text-dark mb-2\">Inauguration by issuing the Token by DC Dr.Selvamani</h4>\n[modula id=\"536\"]\n<h4 class=\"h5 fw-bold text-dark mb-3\">Shivamogga News</h4>\n<p class=\"mb-2 fw-semibold text-dark\">ಫುಡ್ ಆನ್ ವಾಲ್ ಈಗ ಶಿವಮೊಗ್ಗದಲ್ಲಿ</p>\n\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled d-flex flex-column gap-2 mb-3\">\n 	<li><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold ukt-article-text-link\" href=\"https://suddilive.in/?p=22154\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://suddilive.in/?p=22154</a></li>\n 	<li><a class=\"text-decoration-none fw-semibold text-success\" href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/EtoTK3YGHQ3JxBhWsVE1cK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ಸುದ್ದಿಲೈವ್ ವಾಟ್ಸಪ್ ಗ್ರೂಪ್ ಗೆ ಸೇರಲು ಈ ಕೆಳಗಿನ ಲಕ್ ಒತ್ತಿ [https://chat.whatsapp.com/EtoTK3YGHQ3JxBhWsVE1cK]</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"mb-3 text-secondary fw-semibold text-dark\">ಅಗತ್ಯವಿರುವವರಿಗೆ ಉಚಿತ ಊಟ, ಶಿವಮೊಗ್ಗದಲ್ಲೀಗ ಫುಡ್ ಆನ್ ವಾಲ್ ಆರಂಭ</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"w